vmclaude delete NAME [--yes]

Deletes a VM that "vmclaude create" made: stops it, removes it from libvirt with
its disk and cloud-init disk, and removes its profile. The shared base image
stays (see "vmclaude prune"). Asks you to type the name unless --yes is given.

Only VMs made by create can be deleted: both the profile and the VM's libvirt
