EOF
      ;;
    connect) cat <<EOF
vmclaude connect [--keep] [--hold] [--no-tmux] [NAME] [-- CLAUDE_ARGS...]
vmclaude NAME [CLAUDE_ARGS...]
vmclaude

Opens Claude Code on the VM. A libvirt VM is started first if it is off.
Without NAME the default VM is used (see "vmclaude default").

On Linux VMs Claude runs in tmux session "claude": if the connection drops,
