vmclaude add NAME [options]

Adds a profile for a VM (or any machine) you already have, or changes settings
of an existing profile: only the options you give change. Then run
"vmclaude setup NAME" once.

Options:
  --host HOST        IP or hostname. Optional with --domain (the IP is found)
