  --no-tmux          run Claude without tmux
  --os linux|windows normally detected on first connect

Examples:
  vmclaude add win10 --domain win10 --user emin              libvirt VM
  vmclaude add srv --host 192.168.1.50 --user dev            any SSH machine
  vmclaude add vbox --host 127.0.0.1 --port 2222 --user dev  VirtualBox port forward
