vmclaude setup NAME [--no-install] [--no-autostart]

Prepares the VM for Claude Code. Safe to run again: done steps are skipped.
  1. SSH key: creates ~/.ssh/vmclaude_ed25519 if needed and adds it to the VM.
     The VM password is asked once, for this step only.
  2. Linux: tmux (with the VM's package manager and sudo) and Claude Code.
