vmclaude autostart NAME on|off

With "on", every interactive SSH login to the VM opens Claude Code, from any
SSH program (a terminal, PuTTY, a phone app). Quit Claude, or press Ctrl-b d,
to get a normal shell. "setup" turns it on.

Skip it for one login (Linux VMs): ssh -o SetEnv=LC_VMCLAUDE=off user@VM
A shell without Claude, on any VM: vmclaude shell NAME

Examples:
  vmclaude autostart dev off
  vmclaude autostart dev on
